Package: odm-client
Version: @VERSION@
Section: admin
Priority: optional
Architecture: @ARCH@
Depends: @DEPENDS@
Maintainer: Open Directory Manager Contributors <hello@example.org>
Homepage: https://github.com/santiagotoro2023/open-directory-manager
Description: Join a Debian machine to an Open Directory Manager domain
 Configures Kerberos and SSSD, joins the domain, installs the machine keytab
 and sets up the policy agent.
 .
 One command: odm-client-install, for servers, desktops and scripted
 provisioning alike.
